            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"03-interrupted-session-recovery\">03 \u00b7 Interrupted-session recovery</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Persist a patch, discard conversational context, and resume indexing and grounded Q&amp;A from files. Inspect the handoff and held-out evidence.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Keep the task, model and fixtures fixed. Inspect evidence before comparing scores.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Runner revision: <code>35f2438de849313d5025960e2e63fe6f66c04178</code>. Opening this notebook displays saved evidence and launches no inference or coding work.</span></span>"
