            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"saved-results\">Saved results</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Preliminary evidence. One timer attempt halted on a local input bound; paid launches are now paused after a separate qualification request returned no usage. No complete comparison blocks or real two-hour exercise are claimed.</span></span><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">No trials are recorded for this project. This is an explicit absence of evidence, not a zero score.</span></span><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Target: three repeats per automated variant. Show task failures, infrastructure failures and missing telemetry separately. Repeats of one task are not independent tasks. Known cost sums exclude unknown amounts; consult the shared ledger for reservations and audited reconciliations.</span></span><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">No run rows to display.</span></span></div>"
